# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile.* (docs/deployment.md). Everything the
# build needs is source; everything here is either regenerated or must never
# leave the machine it was written on.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
.git
.github
.playwright-cli
e2e/.auth
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
OBDM Backend Plan_files

# Secrets. A deployment supplies its environment to the container, never a file.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deploy/.env*
